  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Explain how the 'sad sights' and 'heavy costs of conquest' described by Radhagupta are vividly illustrated by the aftermath of the Kalinga battle.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Evaluate the significance of Ashoka's declaration, 'no longer will the sword be my message, but henceforth, I devote myself to peace,' in the context of his previous ambition.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('02844c54-aa09-4498-a7e5-c676bbe54baf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Emperor Ashoka, initially a fierce warrior, underwent a profound transformation after the Battle of Kalinga. He renounced violence, embraced Buddhism, and dedicated his reign to spreading peace and moral law. His legacy, marked by stone pillars, symbolizes his evolution from a brutal conqueror to a compassionate ruler.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('71474254-1f73-4c25-be46-fc9bd0d0b294', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Radhagupta, Ashoka's wise and compassionate advisor, played a crucial role in the Mauryan court. When Ashoka expressed his ambition to conquer Kalinga, a land of wealth and beauty, Radhagupta cautioned him, highlighting the dangers and the potential high cost of such a victory, despite Kalinga's brave and loyal warriors.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('145905f3-2526-4ea0-b65a-d34329bc943a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The Mauryan Empire, under Ashoka, sought to expand its dominion. Ashoka viewed Kalinga as a strategic prize, believing its conquest would render his empire 'unmatched, a symbol of prosperity and power, a true golden realm.' This ambition was a driving force in his early reign.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('613a37a3-cdd9-4ae5-91b1-4621c031272c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The throne room of the Royal Palace is depicted as a place of luxury, filled with the scent of sandalwood and the rustle of silk robes. Here, Ashoka, surrounded by his council, contemplates the expansion of his empire, particularly the rich land of Kalinga.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('b16342ff-a499-47ac-b65b-23a0851f6863', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The narrative introduces Ashoka's family members: Mahinda, his son, and Vitashoka, his gentle younger brother. While their direct roles are not yet detailed, their presence in the character list suggests potential future interactions or influences on Ashoka's journey.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5968c38a-916b-4130-98ff-8b0093d22fdf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The 'Learning Outcomes' for the lesson include reading with correct pronunciation, learning new words, appreciating the theme, answering questions, and using degrees of comparison. These outcomes highlight the multifaceted educational goals of the text.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c69ecdac-4647-4a00-bc41-1f3153168f7b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's journey is explicitly stated as one 'from a cruel conqueror to a symbol of peace and compassion.' This transformation is central to his enduring legacy and is physically represented by the stone pillars he erected.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fb239ec8-19cb-4430-bdc2-bbe6e7b719ee', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Radhagupta's warning, 'Kalinga is not an easy prize. It is a land of brave warriors loyal to a wise and fierce king. The path to Kalinga is full of danger, and even if we win, the cost may be greater than expected,' provides a stark counterpoint to Ashoka's eagerness for conquest.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('2b24d2fd-7a29-4fe7-b38d-5a0213987643', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The introduction to 'Ashoka: The Quest For Peace' immediately places the story within the historical context of the Mauryan dynasty and introduces Ashoka the Great. It foreshadows his dramatic change after a pivotal battle.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('873b5e98-3b2a-4e0e-9f66-4563ccd31dc7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story's setting is 'Ancient India, various locations within the Mauryan Empire.' This broad geographical scope suggests a narrative that will cover significant movements and events across a vast dominion.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('9a4f1e3c-4153-4d77-9330-2257c8295d16', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's initial character as a 'fierce warrior king' is contrasted with his later dedication to 'spreading peace and moral law.' This dichotomy is central to understanding his historical significance.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f5b6124c-2dca-491f-af5f-f2f97cbfe6a5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The throne room scene emphasizes Ashoka's pride and his position of power, surrounded by his council of 'wise men and brave generals.' This highlights the collective decision-making process, even if Ashoka holds ultimate authority.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1ed6edf6-f2ed-4d44-92dd-475cdc23b90e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's ambition to conquer Kalinga is framed as a desire to make his empire 'unmatched.' This suggests a pursuit of ultimate supremacy and a rejection of any perceived equals.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('bef4d0f0-5eae-42a3-a629-a2be8c40e68a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Radhagupta's description of Kalinga's king as 'wise and fierce' indicates that the opposition is formidable, not merely in military strength but also in leadership.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ef98413e-6c70-475e-b627-920daf3a1448', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text explicitly mentions 'English-8' and 'Learning Outcomes' as part of the page. This indicates the educational context and the target audience for this material.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ab6b847c-1736-47b5-848d-b9df94126841', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The pre-reading activity asks, 'Have you ever had a moment that made you change how you think or act? Share what happened and how it has changed you. Discuss in class.' This question directly connects to the central theme of Ashoka's transformation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3565d325-0813-491c-a1c3-83ffb4b81662', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's reign, after his transformation, became known for 'enlightenment and prosperity.' This suggests a period of intellectual and spiritual growth alongside material well-being.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('2f635d42-c40d-473d-83e7-52828c3bb9d6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The Narrator's role is to 'provide commentary and add depth to the story.' This suggests an omniscient perspective that can offer insights beyond the characters' immediate experiences.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('55545d1f-6fa4-4bf8-8dd8-68cec7389bb0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The description of the throne room includes 'the soft rustle of silk robes.' This detail, along with the scent of sandalwood, contributes to the opulent and refined atmosphere of the royal court.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('dd4a355d-1e08-4118-b17d-2ca63e223654', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's initial description as a 'brutal conqueror' contrasts sharply with his later identity as a 'symbol of peace and compassion.' This dramatic shift is the core of his historical narrative.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ba86ac13-b0c1-43c3-873b-49dc39033958', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text states that Ashoka 'gave up violence' and 'embraced Buddhism.' This direct cause-and-effect relationship highlights the power of religious conversion in shaping a ruler's policies.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7b4ed1a4-ba90-46f3-a657-90177f8ebe71', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Radhagupta's comparison of Ashoka's dreams to 'an eagle in the sky' acknowledges the grandeur of Ashoka's ambition while subtly hinting at its potential detachment from reality or practical difficulties.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1e72d0d7-30d2-4313-bb78-b892e5331ab9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka's desire for an 'unmatched' empire, a 'symbol of prosperity and power,' and a 'true golden realm' reflects a common imperial aspiration for ultimate dominance and glory.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('bdb7ee12-9f53-4773-9df4-812a6dbe426b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The pre-reading section encourages class discussion on personal transformative moments. This pedagogical approach aims to make the historical narrative relatable and personally meaningful to students.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('094726bb-c07e-4831-9f20-6c5613dac0ab', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka, the mighty ruler, was advised by Radhagupta to temper his ambition with caution regarding the impending conflict with Kalinga. Despite this wise counsel, Ashoka's heart was set on conquest, and he declared, 'We will contest the warriors of Kalinga. Let the war drums sound, for we march at dawn.' The council, without dissent, nodded in agreement. Soon after, a messenger confirmed Kalinga's readiness, preparing its armies and strengthening its walls.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('47f8cf79-14d9-4d67-aa31-61964920f392', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The war with Kalinga raged for months, culminating in Ashoka's victory. However, the battlefield was left a scarred landscape, muddy and filled with wreckage. Ashoka, wearing bloodstained armour, surveyed the aftermath with a heart heavy with sorrow. He questioned, 'What destruction have our ambitions caused? Here lie the young and brave; their lives ended by my commands. Is this the glory we sought?'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('96a5e38c-306e-4c56-a4c9-0a205fb6d727', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Before the dawn march, Mauryan soldiers were seen putting on their armour and sharpening their swords, with war drums echoing in the air. Simultaneously, Kalingan warriors painted their faces for war and readied their shields, chanting loudly to show their resolve to defend their land. Both sides were clearly prepared for a brutal conflict.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1cad03f9-d134-43f7-803e-7a6fc63d8407', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka, after witnessing the devastation of Kalinga, reflected on the human cost of his ambition: 'Why do we conquer if the price is the lives of innocents? Have we become so used to the cries of the suffering that we no longer feel their pain?' This profound introspection suggests a significant shift in his perspective.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('27150dd3-2943-4457-a454-92aa3ebe6488', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text describes the Kalinga war as having 'claimed thousands of lives, leaving both sides in despair despite Ashoka’s victory.' This outcome challenges the conventional notion of a 'victorious' war.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3f0e0c21-e176-467e-b869-f0b18d5e1817', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka declared, 'We will contest the warriors of Kalinga. Let the war drums sound, for we march at dawn. Prepare our soldiers; tomorrow we shall witness the might of Ashoka!' This statement encapsulates his initial confidence and determination.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ad5f897c-c4be-4f6a-9863-bd7ae89607e2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The messenger's arrival with 'urgent news from the east' stating 'Kalinga is preparing its armies and strengthening its walls, ready for our advance' confirms the inevitability and mutual readiness for conflict.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('872d24e8-5812-4432-988e-1aa92af4ec60', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The scene on the Battlefield of Kalinga is described as 'large, muddy... filled with the wreckage of war. The once beautiful landscape is now scarred by the horrors of conflict.' This vivid imagery sets a somber tone.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('86d36dae-9375-4150-84ab-f155f55eec9e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The Battle of Kalinga marked an important turning point in Ashoka’s life. The battlefield, once filled with the cries of warriors and the clash of swords, now lay silent, bearing witness to the immense loss and suffering. The sight of countless lives lost and the profound sorrow of the surviving families struck a chord deep within Ashoka’s heart. This moment of realisation became the catalyst for his transformation. Radhagupta's counsel, 'Oh, mighty Emperor, the sad sights of this battlefield show the heavy costs of conquest. Maybe the heavens call for a new path—one not paved with the bodies of the innocents but lit by peace and kindness,' further solidified Ashoka's resolve.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4b064f30-0b75-4a02-8aa5-fb9ad595f02e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Let us go back to the Mauryan dynasty and learn about Ashoka the Great. Initially, Ashoka was a fierce warrior king. However, after witnessing the terrible aftermath of the Battle of Kalinga, he changed completely. He gave up violence, embraced Buddhism and dedicated his rule to spreading peace and moral law. His reign became known for enlightenment and prosperity. Even today, his legacy is admired, represented by stone pillars that mark his journey from a cruel conqueror to a symbol of peace and compassion.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('4e0cfd42-e75f-4495-9ade-4cfa0196e91e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Setting: Ancient India, various locations within the Mauryan Empire Characters: e Ashoka: the powerful Mauryan emperor who evolves from a brutal conqueror to a peaceful ruler Radhagupta: Ashoka’s wise and compassionate advisor e Mahinda: Ashoka’s son Vitashoka: Ashoka’s gentle younger brother English-8 ° Narrator: provides commentary and adds depth to the story$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('251788c6-6738-4e9a-a07e-c866d24250e2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[ACT 1, Scene 1: The Royal Palace - Throne Room] [The luxurious throne room is filled with the scent of sandalwood and the soft rustle of silk robes. Ashoka sits proudly on his throne, surrounded by his council of wise men and brave generals, thinking about expanding his empire.]$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('dd671548-d9af-4c0b-93b4-79d838825e78', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka: My respected council, look at our great empire. Beyond it is Kalinga, a land of wealth and beauty that we have not yet conquered. If we bring Kalinga under our rule, our empire will be unmatched, a symbol of prosperity and power, a true golden realm.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('735c4d35-c807-4573-8f65-5ef785bc6184', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Radhagupta: My lord, your dreams are high like an eagle in the sky, but remember that Kalinga is not an easy prize. It is a land of brave warriors loyal to a wise and fierce king. The path to Kalinga is full of danger, and even if we win, the cost may be greater than expected.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('721257de-4289-4c47-9f32-ced492400ef4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$After the lesson, I will be able to: i read the text with correct pronunciation, ' intonation and expressions v * learn newwords and use them in sentences ! * explore and appreciate the theme answer questions based on the story use degrees of comparison correctly in sentences$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('25f84d73-8f44-45f6-bdf8-bec097f5b3cf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Have you ever had a moment that made you change how you think or act? Share what happened and how it has changed you. Discuss in class.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5f4b4922-b1ce-4abd-b4e3-aca4f1dd3eb1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka: The Quest For Peace-| Pre-Reading f Learning Outcomes Saeed ; After the lesson, I will be able to: i read the text with correct pronunciation, ' intonation and expressions v * learn newwords and use them in sentences ! * explore and appreciate the theme answer questions based on the story use degrees of comparison correctly in sentences Have you ever had a moment that made you change how you think or act? Share what happened and how it has changed you. Discuss in class.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
