  ('8efe3c5a-f007-4d1a-a5e1-98bf21f27b5d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$He gave up violence, embraced Buddhism and dedicated his rule to spreading peace and moral law. His reign became known for enlightenment and prosperity.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('bb4e0e2b-f3e1-4332-894c-dc053685e3ac', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Even today, his legacy is admired, represented by stone pillars that mark his journey from a cruel conqueror to a symbol of peace and compassion.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fb58ccee-0fe9-4bdd-80c4-da4dc331a11d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Setting: Ancient India, various locations within the Mauryan Empire Characters: e Ashoka: the powerful Mauryan emperor who evolves from a brutal conqueror to a peaceful ruler Radhagupta: Ashoka’s wise and compassionate advisor$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('046be98f-1b9c-4b49-8161-7532693b6a2d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$e Mahinda: Ashoka’s son Vitashoka: Ashoka’s gentle younger brother English-8 ° Narrator: provides commentary and adds depth to the story$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a8761d05-f230-4e4e-ba48-48e243eec776', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$[ACT 1, Scene 1: The Royal Palace - Throne Room] [The luxurious throne room is filled with the scent of sandalwood and the soft rustle of silk robes. Ashoka sits proudly on his throne, surrounded by his council of wise men and brave generals, thinking about expanding his empire.]$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('24bda002-9d25-4619-8680-6d3c924d8a35', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Ashoka: My respected council, look at our great empire. Beyond it is Kalinga, a land of wealth and beauty that we have not yet conquered. If we bring Kalinga under our rule, our empire will be unmatched, a symbol of prosperity and power, a true golden realm.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('e547ec7a-6bcb-4a45-8c0a-9c87baba6238', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Radhagupta: My lord, your dreams are high like an eagle in the sky, but remember that Kalinga is not an easy prize. It is a land of brave warriors loyal to a wise and fierce king.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3c233932-65ae-4cc6-b8f4-b43f950c00b4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The path to Kalinga is full of danger, and even if we win, the cost may be greater than expected.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('31ce283f-6338-4651-84fc-6fd2230ea154', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Do you think Ashoka will pay heed to Radhagupta’s advice? Why/Why not? Ashoka: Wise Radhagupta, your words temper my ambition with caution. Yet, my heart is set on this path. We will contest the warriors of Kalinga. Let the war drums sound, for we march at dawn. Prepare our soldiers; tomorrow we shall witness the might of Ashoka! [The council nods in agreement. A messenger arrives with urgent information.] Messenger: Hail, ruler of the mighty Mauryan Empire! Urgent news from the east. Kalinga is preparing its armies and strengthening its walls, ready for our advance. [As dawn breaks, Mauryan soldiers put on their armour and sharpen their swords, while war drums echo in the air. At the same time, Kalingan warriors paint their faces for war and ready their shields, chanting loudly to show their resolve to defend their land.] [ACT 2, Scene 2: The Battlefield Of Kalinga] [The large, muddy battlefield is filled with the wreckage of war. The once beautiful landscape is now scarred by the horrors of conflict. Amidst this chaos, Ashoka, wearing bloodstained armour, looks over the aftermath, his heart heavy with sorrow. The war, which raged for months, has claimed thousands of lives, leaving both sides in despair despite Ashoka’s victory.] Ashoka: What destruction have our ambitions caused? Here lie the young and brave; their lives ended by my commands. Is this the glory we sought? Why do we conquer if the price is the lives of innocents? Have we become so used to the cries of the suffering that we no longer feel their pain?$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 24, NULL),
  ('9f8225d3-253e-4bad-a690-5e5e0e5097ac', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'b2044359-9915-41b5-badd-087e8eb4ab2b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Do you think ambitious Ashoka should have listened to Radhagupta’s advice? Radhagupta: Oh, mighty Emperor, the sad sights of this battlefield show the heavy costs of conquest. Maybe the heavens call for a new path—one not paved with the bodies of the innocents but lit by peace and kindness. Ashoka: Radhagupta, your counsel falls like gentle rain, quenching the fires of destruction. Today, I am changed in nature; no longer will the sword be my message, but henceforth, I devote myself to peace. This ground, soaked with blood, shall be the last to see such tragedy under my rule. [The Battle of Kalinga marked an important turning point in Ashoka’s life. The battlefield, once filled with the cries of warriors and the clash of swords, now lay silent, bearing witness to the immense loss and suffering. The sight of countless lives lost and the profound sorrow of the surviving families struck a chord deep within Ashoka’s heart. This moment of realisation became the catalyst for his transformation.]$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-549Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL);
